    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of monsters coming in waves in Survivor TD, a tower-defense mixed with roguelite gameplay.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/a279b1fe1b5064192d518859bd3a1d44.poster.avif?t=1752395910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/a279b1fe1b5064192d518859bd3a1d44.webm?t=1752395910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/a279b1fe1b5064192d518859bd3a1d44.mp4?t=1752395910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers and walls to manipulate enemy behavior and become an invincible architect.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/166f5dc2ba61ec69851d964acb86b3db.poster.avif?t=1752395910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/166f5dc2ba61ec69851d964acb86b3db.webm?t=1752395910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/166f5dc2ba61ec69851d964acb86b3db.mp4?t=1752395910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features !</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy thousands of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own maze and battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start new runs with empowered abilities through the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different perks to create varied builds</p></li></ul>",
